    "description": "Collectibles Mineral Specimen Box Set! Rocks, Minerals Collection 20 Piece\nColor\n: Multi-color\nDepartment\n: Collectibles & Art\nCategory\n: Collectibles & Art\nCondition\n: Fair: Noticeable visible imperfections\nDescription\n: Discover the fascinating world of geology with this vintage boxed set of 20 assorted rock and mineral specimens. Each specimen, neatly labeled in its own compartment, includes classics such as Azurite, Barite, Quartz, Mica, Iron Pyrite, and more, offering a colorful and educational display for collectors, students, or enthusiasts.\nThe collection comes in its original cream-colored sturdy box, making it ideal as a gift for budding geologists or as a unique display item for your collection. Individual stones are unmounted and vary in size and shape, showcasing their natural textures and hues. Measuring approximately 7.5 x 5.5 inches, the set is compact for easy storage or display.\nWhether you're starting a collection or expanding your geological library, this authentic vintage set combines educational value and timeless appeal. Bid with confidencean original and complete collector's item preserved in excellent condition.\nUSED ITEMS DISCLAIMER:\nPlease note that all items have been donated. All items are used and untested (including battery life & functionality), lots are unsorted, unless otherwise noted. We do our best to ensure the quality of all our auctions & describe them accurately; however, we are not experts in any field. Items may contain unseen flaws or unknown missing parts not noted in the description.\nAll items are sold AS IS.\nIf you need further information about an item, please contact us prior to the close of the auction.\nTERMS OF SALE:\nOrders must be paid for within seven (7) days from the close of auction. All orders not paid within ten (10) days from the close of auction will be relisted for auction without further notice. Displays used to stage product are not included in purchase. Auctions cannot be combined if listed as such under Shipping tab.\nAUTHENTICATION:\nWe do not authenticate or appraise auction items, unless otherwise indicated in auction description or photographs.",
